// TraderScarcity - multi-option crafting recipes.
//
// Each recipe lets the player pick ONE input from "AnyOf" and ONE output from "OneOf".
//   Id       - unique, stable name. Each option's in-game recipe is tied to its Id and its position in AnyOf/OneOf.
//              Renaming an Id loses crafts in progress for that recipe. Reordering or removing options changes which
//              output an in-progress craft gives - or loses it, if its slot no longer exists. Add new options at the END.
//   Area     - Workbench, MedStation, NutritionUnit (Kitchen), IntelligenceCenter, ... or the area number
//   Level    - area level required
//   Minutes  - craft time. An output can override it with its own "Minutes".
//   Color    - optional tile colour for the client plugin with Usable Crafting, e.g. "#3a7bd5" (add 2 more digits for opacity)
//   Tools    - item ids needed but not used up (optional)
//   Extras   - items always used up, whichever input is picked (optional)
//   AnyOf    - input options: { "Item": id, "Count": n } or a bundle { "Items": [ { "Item": id, "Count": n }, ... ] }
//   OneOf    - output options: { "Item": id, "Count": n, "Minutes": optional }
// Items are 24 character template ids. Bad entries are skipped with a warning in the server console.
// Default balance: outputs are just below the handbook price of the inputs.
